Third-party models that OpenBark can download are not distributed in this
repository. When a model is offered in the app's catalog, its license and any
required attribution are shown before download.

The iPhone app ships four speech models inside the app, so it records and
transcribes offline right after install: Silero VAD (MIT), Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 int8
(CC-BY-4.0), pyannote/segmentation-3.0 (MIT) and WeSpeaker VoxCeleb
ResNet34-LM (CC-BY-4.0), each credited below and on the app's Models screen.
They are the files pinned in engine/os-models/catalog.json, unchanged.

