The optional GPU speech pack (Windows, NVIDIA) is downloaded on the user's
request and is not distributed here: ONNX Runtime (MIT, by Microsoft, in the
CUDA build published by k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx) and NVIDIA's CUDA runtime, cuBLAS
and cuDNN libraries, which are NVIDIA's software under NVIDIA's license and
are fetched from NVIDIA's own packages after the user accepts that license.

The optional MLX engine pack (Mac with Apple silicon, macOS 14 or later) is
downloaded on the user's request and is not distributed here: a standalone
CPython build from the python-build-standalone project (Python under the PSF
License, build scripts MPL-2.0), and the Python packages MLX and mlx-lm (MIT,
by Apple Inc.), llguidance (MIT, by Microsoft Corporation), Transformers and
