BSD, Apache-2.0, ISC, PSF-2.0, MPL-2.0 (tqdm, with MIT), CNRI-Python (regex,
with Apache-2.0) and, in NumPy, also 0BSD, Zlib and CC0-1.0 terms; each
package's license is listed in docs/mlx-pack-pins.md.

